OL,3,ANHS trust prosecuted over children's
OL,4,Asepsis deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS trust is being prosecuted over
OL,7,Fthe deaths of two children who had
OL,8,Fsepsis, the BBC has learned.
OL,10,FTwo charges relate to Zadie Ajetunmobi,
OL,11,Fthree, who died within hours of being
OL,12,Ftaken to Broomfield Hospital, Essex,
OL,13,Fwith a temperature of 40C (104F) in
OL,14,FNovember 2022.
OL,16,FA third regards two-year-old Selina
OL,17,FSamarina, who was sent home by a doctor
OL,18,Fat Broomfield in April 2024, only to
OL,19,Fdie two days later.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
