OL,3,ANHS trust prosecuted over children's
OL,4,Asepsis deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FMid and South Essex NHS Foundation
OL,7,FTrust (MSE), which runs the hospital,
OL,8,Fsaid it was "working closely" with
OL,9,Finvestigators. It is due before
OL,10,FChelmsford Magistrates' Court in
OL,11,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
